{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36197","headline":"又叙雪寄喻凫 · 方干","name":"又叙雪寄喻凫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"密片繁声旋不销，萦风杂霰转飘颻。\n澄江莫蔽长流色，衰柳难黏自动条。\n湿气添寒酤酒夜，素花迎曙卷帘朝。\n此时明迳无行迹，唯望徽之问寂寥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36197.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36197","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}